From: Moritz Bunkus <mo@bunkus.online>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 11:50:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] avilib: guard against memory allocation failures

---
 lib/avilib-0.6.10/avilib.c | 104 +++++++++++++++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 64 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/avilib-0.6.10/avilib.c b/lib/avilib-0.6.10/avilib.c
index abe2122f5..560cf4522 100644
